    ManagementUnsupported("This dashboard does not offer the requested management feature. Check the URL and Hermes version.","此仪表盘不提供请求的管理功能。请检查地址和 Hermes 版本。","Cǐ yíbiǎopán bù tígōng qǐngqiú de guǎnlǐ gōngnéng. Qǐng jiǎnchá dìzhǐ hé Hermes bǎnběn."),
    ManagementFailed("The management server reported an error. Refresh to verify the current state.","管理服务器报告错误。请刷新以验证当前状态。","Guǎnlǐ fúwùqì bàogào cuòwù. Qǐng shuāxīn yǐ yànzhèng dāngqián zhuàngtài."),
    ManagementInvalid("Check the dashboard HTTPS URL and selected profile. The returned sign-in or configuration could not be verified.","请检查仪表盘 HTTPS 地址和选定配置。无法验证返回的登录或配置。","Qǐng jiǎnchá yíbiǎopán HTTPS dìzhǐ hé xuǎndìng pèizhì. Wúfǎ yànzhèng fǎnhuí de dēnglù huò pèizhì."),
    ManagementInterrupted("Management connection interrupted or sign-in timed out. Check your network and refresh. If a sign-in or renewal response was lost, start a new browser sign-in.","管理连接中断或登录超时。请检查网络并刷新。如果登录或续期响应丢失，请重新使用浏览器登录。","Guǎnlǐ liánjiē zhōngduàn huò dēnglù chāoshí. Qǐng jiǎnchá wǎngluò bìng shuāxīn. Rúguǒ dēnglù huò xùqī xiǎngyìng diūshī, qǐng chóngxīn shǐyòng liúlǎnqì dēnglù."),
    McpToggle("Change MCP enabled state","更改 MCP 启用状态","Gēnggǎi MCP qǐyòng zhuàngtài"),
    McpEnable("Enable MCP server","启用 MCP 服务器","Qǐyòng MCP fúwùqì"),
    McpDisable("Disable MCP server","禁用 MCP 服务器","Jìnyòng MCP fúwùqì"),
    McpRemove("Remove MCP configuration","移除 MCP 配置","Yíchú MCP pèizhì"),
    McpProbe("Test MCP connection","测试 MCP 连接","Cèshì MCP liánjiē"),
    McpProbeEffect("Connect to this configured MCP server and list its tools. This may start its configured process on the host.","连接此已配置的 MCP 服务器并列出工具。这可能在主机上启动其配置的进程。","Liánjiē cǐ yǐ pèizhì de MCP fúwùqì bìng lièchū gōngjù. Zhè kěnéng zài zhǔjī shàng qǐdòng qí pèizhì de jìnchéng."),
    McpChangeEffect("Change only this profile's selected MCP configuration. Changes affect new sessions or gateway reloads. Existing work and processes may continue.","仅更改此配置中选定的 MCP 设置。更改在新会话或网关重载时生效。现有工作和进程可能继续。","Jǐn gēnggǎi cǐ pèizhì zhōng xuǎndìng de MCP shèzhì. Gēnggǎi zài xīn huìhuà huò wǎngguān chóngzài shí shēngxiào. Xiànyǒu gōngzuò hé jìnchéng kěnéng jìxù."),
    McpUnsupportedName("This server name cannot use the supported control route.","此服务器名称无法使用受支持的控制路由。","Cǐ fúwùqì míngchēng wúfǎ shǐyòng shòu zhīchí de kòngzhì lùyóu."),
    McpPluginManaged("Configuration is managed by a plugin or an unrecognized source. Enable/remove changes are unavailable here.","配置由插件或未知来源管理。此处无法更改启用状态或移除配置。","Pèizhì yóu chājiàn huò wèizhī láiyuán guǎnlǐ. Cǐchù wúfǎ gēnggǎi qǐyòng zhuàngtài huò yíchú pèizhì."),
    McpProbeReady("The connection test returned available tools.","连接测试返回了可用工具。","Liánjiē cèshì fǎnhuí le kěyòng gōngjù."),
    McpProbeFailed("The connection test reported unavailable tools or missing authentication. Check the server configuration.","连接测试报告工具不可用或缺少认证。请检查服务器配置。","Liánjiē cèshì bàogào gōngjù bù kěyòng huò quēshǎo rènzhèng. Qǐng jiǎnchá fúwùqì pèizhì."),
    McpToolCount("Tools reported (up to 100 names shown):","报告的工具数（最多显示 100 个名称）：","Bàogào de gōngjù shù (zuìduō xiǎnshì yībǎi ge míngchēng):"),
    McpAbsent("Configuration is absent.","配置不存在。","Pèizhì bù cúnzài."),
    ManagementReviewChanged("The reviewed target or configuration changed. Review it again before sending.","已核查的目标或配置已更改。发送前请重新核查。","Yǐ héchá de mùbiāo huò pèizhì yǐ gēnggǎi. Fāsòng qián qǐng chóngxīn héchá."),
    ManagementReadbackPending("The server acknowledged the action, but its current configuration could not be verified. Read the current configuration before another change.","服务器已确认操作，但无法验证当前配置。再次更改前请读取当前配置。","Fúwùqì yǐ quèrèn cāozuò, dàn wúfǎ yànzhèng dāngqián pèizhì. Zàicì gēnggǎi qián qǐng dúqǔ dāngqián pèizhì."),
    ManagementOutcomePending("Review the uncertain management outcome before another action on this profile. Requests are never repeated automatically.","对此配置执行其他操作前，请核查不确定的管理结果。请求不会自动重复。","Duì cǐ pèizhì zhíxíng qítā cāozuò qián, qǐng héchá bù quèdìng de guǎnlǐ jiéguǒ. Qǐngqiú bú huì zìdòng chóngfù."),
    ManagementAlreadyObserved("The requested configuration is already present. No change was sent.","请求的配置状态已存在。未发送更改。","Qǐngqiú de pèizhì zhuàngtài yǐ cúnzài. Wèi fāsòng gēnggǎi."),
    ManagementObservationOnly("This is a current configuration observation. It does not settle an uncertain earlier action.","这是对当前配置的观察，不能确定先前不确定操作的结果。","Zhè shì duì dāngqián pèizhì de guānchá, bù néng quèdìng xiānqián bù quèdìng cāozuò de jiéguǒ."),
    ManagementReceipts("Management action history","管理操作历史","Guǎnlǐ cāozuò lìshǐ"),
    ManagementSending("Action is being sent.","正在发送操作。","Zhèngzài fāsòng cāozuò."),
    ManagementUncertain("Outcome uncertain — no automatic repeat.","结果不确定——不会自动重复。","Jiéguǒ bù quèdìng, bú huì zìdòng chóngfù."),
    ManagementAcknowledged("Server acknowledged; configuration not yet verified.","服务器已确认；配置尚未验证。","Fúwùqì yǐ quèrèn; pèizhì shàng wèi yànzhèng."),
    ManagementVerified("Result received and configuration verified.","已收到结果并验证配置。","Yǐ shōudào jiéguǒ bìng yànzhèng pèizhì."),
    ManagementReviewed("Uncertain outcome reviewed locally.","已在本机核查不确定结果。","Yǐ zài běnjī héchá bù quèdìng jiéguǒ."),
    ManagementResult("View result","查看结果","Chákàn jiéguǒ"),
    ManagementReadCurrent("Read current configuration","读取当前配置","Dúqǔ dāngqián pèizhì"),
    ManagementReview("Review uncertainty","核查不确定结果","Héchá bù quèdìng jiéguǒ"),
    ManagementReviewEffect("Mark this outcome reviewed on this device? This does not cancel server work or resend the request. Read the current configuration first when possible.","将此结果标记为已在本机核查？这不会取消服务器工作或重新发送请求。请尽可能先读取当前配置。","Jiāng cǐ jiéguǒ biāojì wéi yǐ zài běnjī héchá? Zhè bú huì qǔxiāo fúwùqì gōngzuò huò chóngxīn fāsòng qǐngqiú. Qǐng jǐnkěnéng xiān dúqǔ dāngqián pèizhì."),
    Confirm("Confirm","确认","Quèrèn"),
    Review("Review","核查","Héchá"),
    McpAdd("Add MCP server","添加 MCP 服务器","Tiānjiā MCP fúwùqì"),
