    PluginInspect("Inspect plugin source","检查插件源","Jiǎnchá chājiàn yuán"),
    PluginSourceInvalid("Use an HTTPS URL without embedded credentials, an owner/repository path, or a git@ SSH identifier.","请使用无内嵌凭据的 HTTPS 地址、所有者/仓库路径或 git@ SSH 标识。","Qǐng shǐyòng wú nèiqiàn píngjù de HTTPS dìzhǐ, suǒyǒuzhě/cāngkù lùjìng huò git@ SSH biāozhì."),
    PluginCatalogUnknown("This catalog name is unknown or withdrawn.","此目录名称未知或已撤回。","Cǐ mùlù míngchēng wèizhī huò yǐ chèhuí."),
    PluginCatalogInvalidName("The host refused this catalog-name format.","主机拒绝此目录名称格式。","Zhǔjī jùjué cǐ mùlù míngchēng géshì."),
    PluginCatalogUnavailable("The host could not read a plugin catalog.","主机无法读取插件目录。","Zhǔjī wúfǎ dúqǔ chājiàn mùlù."),
    PluginCatalogBoundary("Reads the host's featured selection or looks up one catalog name. The host may use its cached or bundled catalog, fetch pinned manifests and check local application availability. Reported application availability describes this host.","读取主机精选列表或查找单个目录名称。主机可能使用缓存或内置目录、获取固定版本清单并检查本地应用可用性。报告的应用可用性描述此主机。","Dúqǔ zhǔjī jīngxuǎn lièbiǎo huò cházhǎo dān gè mùlù míngchēng. Zhǔjī kěnéng shǐyòng huǎncún huò nèizhì mùlù, huòqǔ gùdìng bǎnběn qīngdān bìng jiǎnchá běndì yìngyòng kěyòngxìng. Bàogào de yìngyòng kěyòngxìng miáoshù cǐ zhǔjī."),
    PluginInspectionEffect("The host may clone this source to inspect its plugin components and commit. A successful inspection may be reused for ten minutes. It installs nothing. Cancelling this wait does not stop a host clone; an explicit later inspection may join that work.","主机可能克隆此源以检查插件组件和提交。成功检查可能复用十分钟。不会安装内容。取消等待不会停止主机克隆；以后明确发起的检查可能加入该任务。","Zhǔjī kěnéng kèlóng cǐ yuán yǐ jiǎnchá chājiàn zǔjiàn hé tíjiāo. Chénggōng jiǎnchá kěnéng fùyòng shí fēnzhōng. Bú huì ānzhuāng nèiróng. Qǔxiāo děngdài bú huì tíngzhǐ zhǔjī kèlóng; yǐhòu míngquè fāqǐ de jiǎnchá kěnéng jiārù gāi rènwù."),
    PluginInspectionRejected("The host could not inspect this source. Inspect its logs for details.","主机无法检查此源。请查看主机日志了解详情。","Zhǔjī wúfǎ jiǎnchá cǐ yuán. Qǐng chákàn zhǔjī rìzhì liǎojiě xiángqíng."),
    PluginInspectionPin("Host-inspected commit","主机检查的提交","Zhǔjī jiǎnchá de tíjiāo"),
    PluginAgentComponent("Agent plugin component reported","报告了智能体插件组件","Bàogào le zhìnéngtǐ chājiàn zǔjiàn"),
    PluginNoAgentComponent("No agent plugin component reported","未报告智能体插件组件","Wèi bàogào zhìnéngtǐ chājiàn zǔjiàn"),
    PluginDesktopComponent("Desktop UI component reported; it runs in the host desktop app.","报告了桌面界面组件；它在主机桌面应用中运行。","Bàogào le zhuōmiàn jièmiàn zǔjiàn; tā zài zhǔjī zhuōmiàn yìngyòng zhōng yùnxíng."),
    PluginNoDesktopComponent("No desktop UI component reported","未报告桌面界面组件","Wèi bàogào zhuōmiàn jièmiàn zǔjiàn"),
    PluginSourceInsecure("The host reports an insecure source scheme.","主机报告源协议不安全。","Zhǔjī bàogào yuán xiéyì bù ānquán."),
    PluginDetails("Plugin details","插件详情","Chājiàn xiángqíng"),
    HostPlugins("Host plugins","主机插件","Zhǔjī chājiàn"),
    PluginRead("Read host plugins","读取主机插件","Dúqǔ zhǔjī chājiàn"),
    PluginInventoryBoundary("Reported plugin configuration for the requested profile. Runtime status and available updates are host reports; this read does not install, enable or update plugins.","所请求配置的插件报告。运行状态和可用更新由主机报告；此读取不会安装、启用或更新插件。","Suǒ qǐngqiú pèizhì de chājiàn bàogào. Yùnxíng zhuàngtài hé kěyòng gēngxīn yóu zhǔjī bàogào; cǐ dúqǔ bú huì ānzhuāng, qǐyòng huò gēngxīn chājiàn."),
    PluginProfileUnsupported("Select an explicit gateway profile. This alias cannot be verified safely.","请选择明确的网关配置。无法安全验证此别名。","Qǐng xuǎnzé míngquè de wǎngguān pèizhì. Wúfǎ ānquán yànzhèng cǐ biémíng."),
    PluginInventoryInvalid("Plugin metadata is unsupported or inconsistent. No plugin change was sent.","插件元数据不受支持或不一致。未发送插件更改。","Chājiàn yuán shùjù bù shòu zhīchí huò bù yīzhì. Wèi fāsòng chājiàn gēnggǎi."),
    PluginUserCount("User plugins","用户插件","Yònghù chājiàn"),
    PluginBundledCount("Bundled plugins","内置插件","Nèizhì chājiàn"),
    PluginServers("Plugin server reports","插件服务器报告","Chājiàn fúwùqì bàogào"),
    PluginTools("Reported tools","报告的工具","Bàogào de gōngjù"),
    PluginUpdateReported("Host reports an available update","主机报告有可用更新","Zhǔjī bàogào yǒu kěyòng gēngxīn"),
    PluginNoUpdateReported("Host reports no available update","主机报告无可用更新","Zhǔjī bàogào wú kěyòng gēngxīn"),
    SkillHubInstalledManagement("Manage Hub installations","管理技能中心安装","Guǎnlǐ jìnéng zhōngxīn ānzhuāng"),
    SkillHubInstalledUnavailable("Installed Hub metadata is unavailable or inconsistent. Refresh or inspect the host before changing files.","已安装技能中心元数据不可用或不一致。更改文件前请刷新或检查主机。","Yǐ ānzhuāng jìnéng zhōngxīn yuán shùjù bù kěyòng huò bù yīzhì. Gēnggǎi wénjiàn qián qǐng shuāxīn huò jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    SkillHubRemove("Remove Hub skill","移除技能中心技能","Yíchú jìnéng zhōngxīn jìnéng"),
    SkillHubUpdateAll("Update all Hub skills in this profile","更新此配置的全部技能中心技能","Gēngxīn cǐ pèizhì de quánbù jìnéng zhōngxīn jìnéng"),
    SkillHubRemoveEffect("Starts host removal of this Hub skill by installed name. It deletes the skill directory, including local edits, and its Hub lock entry. Removal is irreversible here; existing agent work may continue.","按安装名称启动主机移除。将删除技能目录（包括本地修改）及技能中心锁记录。此处无法撤销；现有智能体任务可能继续。","Àn ānzhuāng míngchēng qǐdòng zhǔjī yíchú. Jiāng shānchú jìnéng mùlù (bāokuò běndì xiūgǎi) jí jìnéng zhōngxīn suǒ jìlù. Cǐchù wúfǎ chèxiāo; xiànyǒu zhìnéngtǐ rènwù kěnéng jìxù."),
    SkillHubUpdateAllEffect("Starts updates for every Hub skill in this profile, including skills added before the process reads its inventory. The host keeps detected local edits and otherwise replaces skill directories when updates are available. The phone does not review each new version.","更新此配置的所有技能中心技能，包括进程读取清单前新添加的技能。主机保留检测到的本地修改，否则在有更新时替换技能目录。手机不会审核每个新版本。","Gēngxīn cǐ pèizhì de suǒyǒu jìnéng zhōngxīn jìnéng, bāokuò jìnchéng dúqǔ qīngdān qián xīn tiānjiā de jìnéng. Zhǔjī bǎoliú jiǎncè dào de běndì xiūgǎi, fǒuzé zài yǒu gēngxīn shí tìhuàn jìnéng mùlù. Shǒujī bú huì shěnhé měi gè xīn bǎnběn."),
    SkillHubUpdatePolicy("Hermes uses its force-update scan policy: caution or review-needed findings may be overridden. Dangerous community/trusted bundles remain blocked. Inspect host logs for individual outcomes.","Hermes 使用强制更新扫描策略：警告或需要审核的结果可能被覆盖。危险的社区或受信任来源技能包仍被阻止。请检查主机日志了解各项结果。","Hermes shǐyòng qiángzhì gēngxīn sǎomiáo cèlüè: jǐnggào huò xūyào shěnhé de jiéguǒ kěnéng bèi fùgài. Wēixiǎn de shèqū huò shòu xìnrèn láiyuán jìnéng bāo réng bèi zǔzhǐ. Qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī rìzhì liǎojiě gè xiàng jiéguǒ."),
    SkillHubMaintenanceRace("The host accepts no revision guard. Current metadata cannot pin files against concurrent edits. Acceptance reports process startup only; cancelling this wait does not stop host work.","主机不支持版本保护。当前元数据无法防止并发文件修改。接受仅表示进程启动；取消等待不会停止主机任务。","Zhǔjī bù zhīchí bǎnběn bǎohù. Dāngqián yuán shùjù wúfǎ fángzhǐ bìngfā wénjiàn xiūgǎi. Jiēshòu jǐn biǎoshì jìnchéng qǐdòng; qǔxiāo děngdài bú huì tíngzhǐ zhǔjī rènwù."),
    SkillHubMaintenanceAccepted("Host accepted skill maintenance startup. Removal/update outcomes are unverified; inspect installed skills or host logs separately.","主机已接受技能维护启动。移除或更新结果未经验证；请另行检查已安装技能或主机日志。","Zhǔjī yǐ jiēshòu jìnéng wéihù qǐdòng. Yíchú huò gēngxīn jiéguǒ wèi jīng yànzhèng; qǐng lìngxíng jiǎnchá yǐ ānzhuāng jìnéng huò zhǔjī rìzhì."),
    SkillHubInstall("Review skill installation","审核技能安装","Shěnhé jìnéng ānzhuāng"),
    SkillHubInstallUnavailable("Installation requires preview content, a qualified Hub identifier and an allowed host scan. Bundled skill restoration requires host setup.","安装需要预览内容、完整的技能中心标识和主机扫描许可。内置技能恢复需要在主机设置。","Ānzhuāng xūyào yùlǎn nèiróng, wánzhěng de jìnéng zhōngxīn biāozhì hé zhǔjī sǎomiáo xǔkě. Nèizhì jìnéng huīfù xūyào zài zhǔjī shèzhì."),
    SkillHubInstallEffect("Starts the host installer for this profile. It downloads and scans again, then writes skill files if allowed. Optional scanner findings remain advisory. Acceptance only reports process startup; cancellation of waiting does not stop the installer.","启动此配置的主机安装程序。程序再次下载和扫描，获准后写入技能文件。可选扫描结果仍为建议。接受仅表示进程启动；取消等待不会停止安装程序。","Qǐdòng cǐ pèizhì de zhǔjī ānzhuāng chéngxù. Chéngxù zàicì xiàzài hé sǎomiáo, huòzhǔn hòu xiěrù jìnéng wénjiàn. Kěxuǎn sǎomiáo jiéguǒ réng wéi jiànyì. Jiēshòu jǐn biǎoshì jìnchéng qǐdòng; qǔxiāo děngdài bú huì tíngzhǐ ānzhuāng chéngxù."),
    SkillHubMutableSource("Source content and host files can change after review. Hermes accepts no content pin or revision guard here. Fresh preview, scan and duplicate checks detect observed changes; they cannot guarantee identical installed bytes.","审核后源内容和主机文件仍可能变化。此接口不支持内容固定或版本保护。重新预览、扫描和重复检查可发现已观察到的变化，但不能保证安装字节完全相同。","Shěnhé hòu yuán nèiróng hé zhǔjī wénjiàn réng kěnéng biànhuà. Cǐ jiēkǒu bù zhīchí nèiróng gùdìng huò bǎnběn bǎohù. Chóngxīn yùlǎn, sǎomiáo hé chóngfù jiǎnchá kě fāxiàn yǐ guānchá dào de biànhuà, dàn bù néng bǎozhèng ānzhuāng zìjié wánquán xiāngtóng."),
    SkillHubInstallAccepted("Host accepted installer startup. Installation completion is unverified; inspect current installed skills or the host logs separately.","主机已接受安装程序启动。安装完成情况未经验证；请另行查看当前已安装技能或主机日志。","Zhǔjī yǐ jiēshòu ānzhuāng chéngxù qǐdòng. Ānzhuāng wánchéng qíngkuàng wèi jīng yànzhèng; qǐng lìngxíng chákàn dāngqián yǐ ānzhuāng jìnéng huò zhǔjī rìzhì."),
    SkillHub("Skill Hub","技能中心","Jìnéng zhōngxīn"),
    SkillHubOfficial("Official catalog","官方目录","Guānfāng mùlù"),
    SkillHubFeatured("Featured","精选","Jīngxuǎn"),
    SkillHubSources("Skill sources","技能源","Jìnéng yuán"),
    SkillHubAllSources("All configured sources","所有已配置来源","Suǒyǒu yǐ pèizhì láiyuán"),
    SkillHubBoundary("Browse this management profile’s configured skill sources. Searches and previews run on the Hermes host and can fetch remote bundles. Installation is a separate action.","浏览此管理配置的技能源。搜索和预览在 Hermes 主机上执行，可能获取远程技能包。安装是单独的操作。","Liúlǎn cǐ guǎnlǐ pèizhì de jìnéng yuán. Sōusuǒ hé yùlǎn zài Hermes zhǔjī shàng zhíxíng, kěnéng huòqǔ yuǎnchéng jìnéng bāo. Ānzhuāng shì dāndú de cāozuò."),
    SkillHubPreview("Preview bundle","预览技能包","Yùlǎn jìnéng bāo"),
    SkillHubPreviewEmpty("The host returned metadata without SKILL.md text.","主机返回了元数据，但没有 SKILL.md 文本。","Zhǔjī fǎnhuí le yuán shùjù, dàn méiyǒu SKILL.md wénběn."),
    SkillHubPreviewHelp("This is the host’s SKILL.md preview and file manifest. Opening it displays source text without running its instructions or installing files.","这是主机提供的 SKILL.md 预览和文件清单。打开仅显示源文本，不运行其中的指令，也不安装文件。","Zhè shì zhǔjī tígōng de SKILL.md yùlǎn hé wénjiàn qīngdān. Dǎkāi jǐn xiǎnshì yuán wénběn, bù yùnxíng qízhōng de zhǐlìng, yě bù ānzhuāng wénjiàn."),
    SkillHubInstalled("Host reports installed","主机报告已安装","Zhǔjī bàogào yǐ ānzhuāng"),
    SkillHubFiles("Bundle file names","技能包文件名","Jìnéng bāo wénjiàn míng"),
    SkillHubScan("Run host scan","运行主机扫描","Yùnxíng zhǔjī sǎomiáo"),
